# Git

Work on **main**. Tags `v1`, `v2`, `v3` are releases; the tag number is the var number.
A hotfix for a released version branches from its tag, tags the next number there, and
merges back. No other branches unless the user names one in that message.

The user commits and tags. Do not commit, stage, or tag unless asked. A commit message
covers only what is uncommitted since the last commit; check `git status` and `git log`
before writing one. The pre-commit hook lints and compiles, and when the commit touches `shader/` it rebuilds
the bundle with Unity and stages `FoliageFX.assetbundle` and `shader/bundle.sources` with it;
the pre-push hook packages.
